[{"title":"游福源寺","author":"林光","text":"南寺烟霞如有待，东湖舴艋偶相催。\n旋收春色归吟笔，肯信花枝负酒杯。\n天气可人惟此日，风光随步遍蒿莱。\n呼儿歌笑僧房月，谁遣罗浮客子来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51524,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴缙折赠牡丹花因与觅莲栽","author":"林光","text":"牡丹花好花端好，莲子纤花实更妍。\n欲识舂陵培植意，花娇实美是天全。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51525,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉谢嘉兴郡守徐惕斋枉驾见顾平湖官署","author":"林光","text":"门横蛛网径封苔，卧病俄惊使报来。\n草芥何人堪接论，云宵巨眼谢频回。\n春风淡荡环衿佩，元酒氤氲落玉杯。\n无限阳和恩育意，却惭衰朽是非材。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51526,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜诸生会馔","author":"林光","text":"讲罢声催六撞钟，青衿冉冉肃西东。\n大烹本为贤才设，窃食堪羞我辈同。\n箪食豆羹皆圣泽，饔人庖吏走春风。\n权舆莫更添诗咏，一饭须酬一寸功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51527,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙己清明日","author":"林光","text":"青饨聊把伴芳樽，柳叶还将插鬓根。\n佛子冈头应聚拜，银瓶岭上独销魂。\n糟妻卧病空挥泪，慈母烧香定倚门。\n南海思归归未得，斜风吹雨正倾盆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51528,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过平湖沈楷炼二秀才宅","author":"林光","text":"乌纱白葛暮春前，何处烟霞得辋川。\n清水人家看入画，罗浮客子笑当筵。\n名花恰对平生眼，怪石真成小洞天。\n萧管莫催山阁雨，清樽红烛愧留连。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51529,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赏牡丹","author":"林光","text":"淑气催人醉未涯，洛阳春色又官衙。\n三千里外留双眼，四十年来见此花。\n惯傍疏梅移晚履，几亲幽菊酌流霞。\n东风一笑延今赏，坐看游蜂到日斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51530,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闽使来聘","author":"林光","text":"平生肉眼非衡鉴，遥枉诸侯走币书。\n两浙官舟催欲发，八闽风物信何如。\n曾贪白月捞潭底，更觅遗珠到海隅。\n俯仰乾坤留一笑，夕阳烟树半模糊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51531,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度紫溪岭","author":"林光","text":"虹光已烛海东头，草露凝珠泾未收。\n翠展晴峦千卷画，凉催孤雁一声秋。\n肩舆忽忽穿林杪，诗思腾腾逐涧流。\n山水八闽端有债，他年空作梦中游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51532,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度分水关","author":"林光","text":"玉笋参天着数峰，清秋留赏兴偏浓。\n东南地脉交分处，闽粤山河控御中。\n关吏逡巡开野酌，丁夫奔走认衰容。\n望郎石畔无纤翳，不道斯文运适通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51533,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望郎石","author":"林光","text":"望郎身寄鬼门西，郎去频年望欲迷。\n心胆已无云雨梦，手中黄口尚提携。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51534,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中初见武夷山","author":"林光","text":"四十年来劳梦想，一杯今始识真容。\n沿流莫遏穷源兴，老我堪寻若个峰。\n仙子迹深山间寂，棹歌声断翠蒙茸。\n怀贤适任搜求责，祇恐虚岩有卧龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51535,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别武夷山","author":"林光","text":"步步移舟步步迟，一回转盼一寻思。\n相看此老终无语，抒写吾心却有诗。\n树色苍苍含别恨，溪流送送出晴漪。\n相逢不尽今朝兴，莫道天留忆武夷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51536,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过延平怀愿中先生","author":"林光","text":"未燃精诚一瓣香，官舟催发向茶洋。\n闽山本为名贤重，溪水何如道脉长。\n城面人家临睥睨，祠前树色照秋阳。\n缅怀高弟枢趋处，应有神灵护讲堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51537,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经小箬","author":"林光","text":"古榕深树碧烟凝，小箬山前望眼明。\n粤客思亲原有泪，軥辀休送断肠声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51538,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"到福州","author":"林光","text":"危滩历尽得安流，十里肩舆向福州。\n人物权衡空自愧，江山英采共谁收。\n栽花只手闲偏惯，阅世双眸老未休。\n箫鼓远劳诸贵迓，一樽同醉玉壶秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51539,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闽南试院典文偶赋","author":"林光","text":"微官何处尽平生，文字真愁误俊英。\n眼底深沈端有分，镜中妍丑本无情。\n香风淡淡飘丹桂，白月迟迟照省城。\n收拾秋光浑未了，更依南斗认疏星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51540,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"试院中秋赏月和章方伯","author":"林光","text":"阅世空惊四十霜，年华如月到中央。\n褰帘共赏人非少，袖手还容我在傍。\n眼底毫芒堪遍烛，酒中斟酌岂须忙。\n八闽诗料元无限，暂借银蟾一夜光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51541,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游鼓山灵源洞因宿鼓山寺六首 其一","author":"林光","text":"石鼓山前兴，经旬念未酬。\n片云来倏忽，空翠任迟留。\n万象归杯酒，千峰豁醉眸。\n不知天壤内，何处是瀛洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51542,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游鼓山灵源洞因宿鼓山寺六首 其二","author":"林光","text":"旋制茅根笔，悬崖欲大书。\n老怀堪尽展，绝景更何如。\n云水真无性，乾坤是客居。\n僧庐新结构，高枕我来初。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51543,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游鼓山灵源洞因宿鼓山寺六首 其三","author":"林光","text":"开山谁是祖，拂袖我今来。\n纵饮宁辞酒，欢书已破苔。\n悬崖搜古迹，绝涧洗黄埃。\n羽化疑今日，天风步步催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51544,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游鼓山灵源洞因宿鼓山寺六首 其四","author":"林光","text":"爱此灵源洞，真成烂熳游。\n名儒书未剥，仙子迹还留。\n喝水僧何去，栖禅窟自幽。\n白云如恋我，飞逐鼓山头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51545,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游鼓山灵源洞因宿鼓山寺六首 其五","author":"林光","text":"何处不堪老，浮生空自忙。\n石门开洞古，松径绕云长。\n恋恋情何极，看看世欲忙。\n难描今日兴，更憩老僧床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51546,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游鼓山灵源洞因宿鼓山寺六首 其六","author":"林光","text":"鼓山今夜月，照见宦游情。\n僧榻尘稀到，松风韵自清。\n谷虚疑有守，城远不闻更。\n忽忆同心侣，朝来合寄声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51547,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐方伯刘太参沈亚参招饮平远台","author":"林光","text":"团团孤石对层峦，小坐堪留半日欢。\n僧径曲随虚阁转，秋山间带夕阳看。\n行云流水情何远，乌帽青天眼自宽。\n更饮香醪添晚醉，诸公忘己我忘官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51548,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重九日张侍御招饮元妙寺时董侍御林大行人泮及弟佥宪包进士咸在席酒酣因和张侍御旧游韵二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"笋舆欲尽碧峰头，翠竹深松景自幽。\n潦倒共拚今日醉，不知萸菊为谁秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51549,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重九日张侍御招饮元妙寺时董侍御林大行人泮及弟佥宪包进士咸在席酒酣因和张侍御旧游韵二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"醉来萸菊满簪头，况值僧居景最幽。\n七步何才争出手，兴馀书破一山秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51550,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沈亚参邀华林寺酌别时徐方伯刘大参索诗留别走笔奉答","author":"林光","text":"闽南风物颇穷搜，更为闽南一日留。\n方伯忽催言别句，越山难尽满怀秋。\n轻阴且莫愁时暮，醴酒还堪话壮游。\n聚散从来非偶事，出门刚念倚门忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51551,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"董侍御宿南察院","author":"林光","text":"乌台清密地，木榻一宵同。\n爱国心逾赤，忧时话至公。\n霜威侵布被，月色透帘栊。\n失记三更梦，鸡声乱晓钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51552,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过壶公山","author":"林光","text":"壶公何物钟灵秀，更为壶公一品题。\n老眼何曾忘五岳，笋舆吟过木兰溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51553,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同安谒朱晦庵先生祠","author":"林光","text":"翻然徒步往忘疲，却忆先生在邑时。\n他日官衔虽主簿，如今斯道却宗谁。\n祠前榕叶聊供扫，炉内枫香逐旋吹。\n无限斜阳凝伫意，寒蝉犹听傍深枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51554,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙溪李邑宰用刘大参韵见赠仍和奉寄","author":"林光","text":"云霄万里看程期，海内何常乏所知。\n黄甲声华君作县，丹霞聚笈我留诗。\n牛刀小试经纶手，襦裤终兴恺悌思。\n寄谢参藩刘伯长，海宾深望抚流离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51555,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢龙溪李廷信明府惠肩舆","author":"林光","text":"笋舆潇洒漳南路，却爱君侯样制工。\n款段惯曾驮李贺，蒲轮今益愧申公。\n行边风日轩窗小，醉里云山兴味浓。\n共敝车裘今几见，可无诗句播闽东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51556,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过恶溪","author":"林光","text":"红桥东接义安城，俯盼洪流一战兢。\n何事鳄鱼驱已久，恶溪犹有恶之名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51557,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潮州谒韩文公祠二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"扶留叶子裹槟榔，欲献君侯恐不尝。\n仰止高山聊展拜，名香一线是心香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51558,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潮州谒韩文公祠二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"香拈一线傍峰头，海色山光共劝酬。\n莫道开元无眼孔，天留声迹重潮州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51559,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潮州林太守邀金山小酌","author":"林光","text":"乌石参差出凤城，一樽聊此话平生。\n磨崖细认模糊字，怕有昌黎刺史名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51560,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别潮州","author":"林光","text":"阃侯兵卒初辞去，刺史渔丁复遣来。\n传食如今非孟子，滩声愁听恶溪雷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51561,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过程乡","author":"林光","text":"溪流曲曲入程乡，蓬底晨吹晚稻香。\n总道渔翁无一事，持篙犹为急滩忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51562,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过龙川","author":"林光","text":"何处逢人话小苏，黄茅冈绕一城孤。\n间关回首闽南路，今日扁舟得顺途。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51563,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河源道中闻秉之囟问","author":"林光","text":"恶声传送耳边来，尚冀流言辍我哀。\n浮世百年真是梦，壮心今日已成灰。\n流溪有恨同呜咽，造化无情故迫催。\n满目云山总愁思，好怀从此向谁开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51564,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惠州阻风","author":"林光","text":"杨风白浪使人愁，两日归舟不自由。\n白鹤峰前悭一顾，却疑苏子暗相流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51565,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"银瓶阡感事","author":"林光","text":"银瓶岭畔剪蒿莱，谁盗坟傍土一坏。\n榻外岂容人鼾睡，眼中刚遇我归来。\n青山到处堪埋骨，古墓边头忍斫培。\n惭愧许孜招感事，空垂血泪抚松栽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51566,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张廷实兼呈白沙先生","author":"林光","text":"酒盏天教酌五湖，浮沈却笑我非夫。\n丝桐挂壁今成懒，天地知音敢谓无。\n两鬓忽随尘梦改，一腔还照月轮孤。\n题诗小放风花手，旋制茅根笔可书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51567,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵白沙先生赠别","author":"林光","text":"诗亦韶音酒亦春，故来江阁坐江云。\n鸾和耳孔开三日，海酌磁瓯醉十分。\n短发催人偏易白，青山留我亦成群。\n通宵柳渡溪头话，一棹烟波却谢君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51568,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒雨","author":"林光","text":"斜斜细雨北风吹，正值春分节近时。\n绿草贪生偏自得，只愁红紫损花枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51569,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浈阳峡舟中偶述寄白沙潮连诸友","author":"林光","text":"溪曲山深月影孤，猿声争亦笑迷途。\n一官老去愁将母，七尺贫来愧病躯。\n耳畔怯逢新杜宇，镜中还是旧头颅。\n江门烟水潮连酒，祇欠园田二顷馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51570,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庄定山先生闻受平湖典教叠韵赠六律依韵奉答 其一","author":"林光","text":"冥鸿天际有遗音，指畔宁须弄我琴。\n流水自存深浅意，白云应识去来心。\n五湖春在身堪老，一棹风多力不任。\n细读医方延道侣，门前芳草履痕深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51571,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庄定山先生闻受平湖典教叠韵赠六律依韵奉答 其二","author":"林光","text":"空中不省是何音，人在烟波指在琴。\n月白风清能几夜，云闲水止若为心。\n双凫落处兴非浅，只手拈时醉莫任。\n浦子城边遗一老，万花丛里坐春深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51572,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庄定山先生闻受平湖典教叠韵赠六律依韵奉答 其三","author":"林光","text":"啼鸟屋角忽传音，懒向西风拂素琴。\n棋局未谙浮世里，马图空认圣人心。\n一锄旷野还堪把，两脚青山病未任。\n颠倒一场春梦醒，出门长笑大江深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51573,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庄定山先生闻受平湖典教叠韵赠六律依韵奉答 其四","author":"林光","text":"武夷曾听棹歌音，闽越归来壁挂琴。\n丹汞可无留世诀，白云长有傍山心。\n平湖风月分诸子，南海烟波钓一任。\n何处折腰还五斗，渊明诗句酒中深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51574,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庄定山先生闻受平湖典教叠韵赠六律依韵奉答 其五","author":"林光","text":"从来至乐是无音，会意深时岂在琴。\n律管候知残腊气，梅花描出老天心。\n何愁病骨医无药，祇恐春杯醉不任。\n痴坐白头何所有，满庭芳草雨中深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51575,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庄定山先生闻受平湖典教叠韵赠六律依韵奉答 其六","author":"林光","text":"谁道东南有赏音，不闻三载定山琴。\n梅花总落题诗手，春雨偏知种树心。\n何处高僧来惠远，他时好语话周任。\n指头江浦平湖路，却恨瓜州一水深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51576,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"参军张兼素挽诗三首 其一","author":"林光","text":"手翰封缄却寄君，忽传凶讣到江滨。\n交情似我空扪泪，真率如君更几人。\n赤手扶危陈短疏，丹心爱国是忠臣。\n芳名自合留青史，岂少封章贲老亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51577,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"参军张兼素挽诗三首 其二","author":"林光","text":"曾接诸贤坐几庵，方斋醇美众交谈。\n三年报政涪兼宿，两府参军北又南。\n故里盖棺君莫憾，他乡闻讣我何堪。\n庐陵忠节诸贤庙，更置罗张亦不惭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51578,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"参军张兼素挽诗三首 其三","author":"林光","text":"江门遥赋忆君诗，正值君亡半月时。\n昨暮云山思共酌，今朝烟雨忽成悲。\n阴阳机括终难识，生死交情更不疑。\n何日西屯挥老泪，为君扶起墓前碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51579,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阻风留别江佥宪兼呈冯提学二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"酒醒斜阳睡起时，瞢腾春思尚如痴。\n扬风白浪摧诗急，却讶诗翁不出司。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51580,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阻风留别江佥宪兼呈冯提学二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"春杯一聚未从容，天意分明又北风。\n庐阜鄱阳他日约，敢将诗债问冯公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51581,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松庄翁挽","author":"林光","text":"病眼摩挲读墓碑，知君有子立清时。\n篇诗此日还堪赋，老泪平生不浪垂。\n新土一丘封寂寂，深松万个色离离。\n荣华欲就孤儿养，不恨琅琊作计迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51582,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵庄定山赠徐佥宪","author":"林光","text":"定山金榜旧同袍，邂逅洪城识俊豪。\n莫道卑官无眼孔，卑官眼孔或时高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51583,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱佥宪母挽","author":"林光","text":"教子劬劬未仕初，灯前绩纺膝前书。\n宪台有禄堪供奉，泉壤无由问起居。\n钱氏千秋思令母，松庄一老共幽庐。\n慈乌反哺心何了，也见光荣七十馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51584,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和顾能","author":"林光","text":"一柱无缘障急流，白云回首思绸缪。\n共拚酒盏销红烛，懒插花枝上黑头。\n鸿鹄心情空自远，江湖烟浪尚韬忧。\n凭君会我难言意，更傍青荷买钓舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51585,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和孙良璧居士","author":"林光","text":"持杯只手是天生，来向当湖弄月明。\n诗债未能酬岭海，斯文何敢说权衡。\n行窝遇乐家家到，好鸟催归日日鸣。\n过眼尘头真易白，与君那惜话衷情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51586,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"如斯亭次韵庄定山","author":"林光","text":"宣父含情伫立时，难言易见却如斯。\n闲观宇宙无穷意，似与鸢鱼两物知。\n活泼泼中那有我，慢腾腾处欲呼谁。\n鳌峰亭子来何日，笑和双泉二老诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51587,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜徐光岳来访平湖","author":"林光","text":"几夜青灯报好花，朝来扶病理乌纱。\n定山妙笔承传信，天姥黄精忽拜嘉。\n违隔仙容刚十载，留连尘榻更谁家。\n卑官莫道无供给，亦有东湖水荐茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51588,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"放诸生依诏侍亲八月九日郑提学宪副驳檄至","author":"林光","text":"梦断丹青指不弹，疏慵关涉事无端。\n宁亲造次容诸子，驳檄分明罪小官。\n乌鸟私情林谷远，圣明恩意海天宽。\n上弦月子中秋近，夜夜呼儿笑共看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51589,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阅诸生课","author":"林光","text":"铢铢两两较高低，眼渐昏来意渐迷。\n弄月吟风程伯子，不知何以学濂溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51590,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]